          │                 │                 │
        WORD              NUMBER            LETTER
          │                 │                 │
     ┌────┼────┐       ┌────┼────┐       ┌────┼────┐
     │    │    │       │    │    │       │    │    │
   Meaning Function  + - × ÷ Power   Shift Reverse
     │       │         │      │         │
 Synonym   Tool       Ratio  Square   Position
 Antonym   Place      Root   Cube     Rearrange
 Cause     Part       Digits Mixed    Alternate
 Effect    Whole
```

